# The API image only needs the code of api/ and src/, its requirements and
# the web dashboard it serves. Everything else stays out: data, credentials
# and git history.
*
!requirements-api.txt
!api/
!src/
!dashboard/
# Offline copy of the dashboard data: the API serves the live one at /tablero
dashboard/data/datos.js
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
api/Dockerfile*
api/requirements-test.txt
